<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/discuss-risk-sensitively-rather-than-using-scare-tactics> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Discuss risk sensitively rather than using scare tactics" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "discuss-risk-sensitively-rather-than-using-scare-tactics" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Lifestyle" ;
    dmo:statement "Discuss risk sensitively rather than employing ‘scare tactics’. It is much more effective to build a person’s self-efficacy; e.g. ‘what’s one thing you could work on to get your blood glucose more stable?’ rather than use a phrase such as ‘your control is poor and will lead to complications’" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Discuss risk sensitively rather than employing ‘scare tactics’. It is much more effective to build a person’s self-efficacy; e.g. ‘what’s one thing you could work on to get your blood glucose more stable?’ rather than use a phrase such as ‘your control is poor and will lead to complications’" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_10_discharge_planning_guideline_with_qr_code_march_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/documenting-and-communicating-discharge-criteria-within-mdt> a dmo:Recommendation ;
